  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - Reason for refusal\r\n\r\nThe proposed rear dormer roof extension, by means of its size, height, excessive width and limited set ins, dominates the dwelling's rear roof plane and does not respect the character of the subject dwelling, the locality's established built form or the inherent quality of the St Paul's Church Conservation Area.  It has also resulted in an unsightly modification to the front roof plane, which is harmful to the appearance of the building and the street scene and is therefore contrary with policies ENV-B.1.1 (All New Development), ENV-B.2.2 (Conservation Areas) and H.6.4 (Housing Extensions) of the London Borough of Hounslow UDP, Adopted December 2003 and the Councils Residential Extensions Guidelines.\r\n"
